#: Modals/enableasmjit.md:2
msgid "--enable-asmjit option"
msgstr "--enable-asmjit オプション"

#: Modals/enableasmjit.md:11
msgid ""
"If, for any reason, you want to disable ASMJIT at runtime you can do by "
"setting the <code>PLUMED_USE_ASMJIT</code> environment variable as shown "
"below:"
msgstr "実行時の ASMJIT は <code>PLUMED_USE_ASMJIT</code> で無効にできます。"
